#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""apply-0.8.1.py — adlc-flightdeck 0.8.0 -> 0.8.1 ("make the record true").

Run from the repo root: python3 docs/plans/patches/apply-0.8.1.py
Two passes: every hunk is checked against the current text of its file (an
exact substring that occurs once, or its replacement already present once),
nothing is written if any check misses; then every file is written back with
its own line endings. A second run is a no-op. Touches the mod in core/ and the
CHANGELOG at the repo root; adapters/ are regenerated by `node scripts/adlc.mjs build`.
"""
